"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b05|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25168,
"en": "Things are gonna be super busy now, by the way!\nWell Kiryu-san, I can't wait until next time!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b05|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25169,
"en": "Seeya!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b05|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25170,
"en": "Yeah, I'll see you.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b05|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25171,
"en": "Next time?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b05|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25172,
"en": "Ah!\nI finally found you, Kiryu-san!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25173,
"en": "You're... the mascot guy.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25174,
"en": "Righto! I'm Ono Michio-kun's\nproducer, Hironaka.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25175,
"en": "I really can't thank you enough for your\nperformance as Ono Michio-kun the other day!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25176,
"en": "Let me guess...\nYou want me to do it again?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25177,
"en": "You're sharper than you look!\nI <font_kind=yakuza_italic>do</font_kind> want that! I do, I do!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25178,
"en": "Hey! Hold on a sec, please!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25179,
"en": "I'm begging you! Michio-kun's popularity has\nbeen through the roof since the last event!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25180,
"en": "We can't just stop now.\nThink about how disappointed your fans would be.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25181,
"en": "You're not dragging me into this again.\nNo way am I doing another talk show.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25182,
"en": "Oh, you don't need to worry, then.\nThat's not what it'll be this time.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25183,
"en": "It's, drum roll... A concert!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25184,
"en": "A concert...?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25185,
"en": "Yup! We've actually been thinking about\nproducing an Ono Michio-kun music CD.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25186,
"en": "But before we can do that, Ono Michio-kun\nwill have to show off his pipes!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25187,
"en": "Kiryu-san. Do you like to sing?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25188,
"en": "Uh, I guess it's not so bad...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25189,
"en": "Perfect! Will you be Ono Michio-kun\nfor our concert then? Whaddya say?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25190,
"en": "Go away.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25191,
"en": "Don't be like that!\nCan't you make an exception for the children?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25192,
"en": "And just think, Michio-kun's rising popularity\nwill be great PR for Onomichi!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25193,
"en": "It'll be a kick in the pants for this sleepy town.\nJust what the aging population needs nowadays.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25194,
"en": "So won't you help me out? For Onomichi.\nI'll reward you handsomely, of course!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25195,
"en": "Not just for the children, but for the town, too...\nI guess I <font_kind=yakuza_italic>do</font_kind> want to give back. What should I do?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25196,
"en": "Sorry, let me think it over.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25197,
"en": "All right! I'll be waiting for you,\nso just let me know when you decide!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25198,
"en": "Fine, I'll do it.\nBut this is the last time, you got it?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25199,
"en": "Anything for my savior!\nCome on, let's get you suited up!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25200,
"en": "That damn costume again...?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25201,
"en": "Mm, a perfect fit! Not that I'm surprised.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25202,
"en": "It's still heavy. And hot. And hard to breathe in.\nAnyway, where's this concert?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25203,
"en": "Well... It's right here!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25204,
"en": "Seriously? This is a pretty strange venue.",
