"en": "The song I want you to sing is called\n<font_kind=yakuza_italic>Today is a Diamond</font_kind>. You know it, right?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25230,
"en": "I do...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25231,
"en": "As you know, the lyrics are amazing!\nYou'll do great! Now, get out there!",
