{
"id": 25276,
"en": "Kiryu-san really has it rough.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25277,
"en": "I've really gotta thank you for today!\nEveryone's so pumped for Michio-kun's debut!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25278,
"en": "You probably would've gone ahead with\nthe CD no matter what score I got, huh?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25279,
"en": "I wonder...\nAnyway, here you go! This is your reward!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25280,
"en": "Oh, and take this!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25281,
"en": "Th-This is...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25282,
"en": "It's a preview of the upcoming Michio-kun CD.\nI wanted you to see it before anyone else!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25283,
"en": "Soooooo? What do you think?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25284,
"en": "Hm... I'm not really sure.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25285,
"en": "Either way, you came through in the clutch there!\nI can't wait until next time!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25286,
"en": "No, I'm finished.\nThere <font_kind=yakuza_italic>is</font_kind> no \"next time.\"",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25287,
"en": "Whattt, really?\nBut he's just getting popular!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25288,
"en": "People will like him no matter who's inside.\nIt doesn't have to be me.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25289,
"en": "You can't keep forcing me into this.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25290,
"en": "I'm not here for fun. There's something important\nI have to do, and I'm damn well gonna do it.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25291,
"en": "I can't help you anymore, you got that?\nYou'll have to move forward on your own.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25292,
"en": "I get it. You were just so good, though.\nThat's why I kept relying on you.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25293,
"en": "But even with your skill,\nI shouldn't have pressured you so much.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25294,
"en": "...I understand.\nI won't trouble you anymore, Kiryu-san.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25295,
"en": "I'll do whatever it takes to make Michio-kun\nthe most popular mascot around!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25296,
"en": "You'll come crawling back asking\nto get inside that costume again, Kiryu-san.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25297,
"en": "That's the spirit. I can't wait.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25298,
"en": "Oh... And take care of Michio.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25299,
"en": "I will!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25300,
"en": "Kiryu-san... Thank you so much!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b23|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25301,
"en": "No, that's not right...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b06|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25302,
"en": "I don't wanna get surgery, Mommy!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b07|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25303,
"en": "They cut you open and stuff, right?\nIt sounds so scary...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b07|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25304,
"en": "But the doctors say you won't have\nmuch time left if you don't get this surgery.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b07|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25305,
"en": "You... You don't want to say goodbye\nto your beloved Ono Michio-kun, do you?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b07|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25306,
"en": "(What was that?)",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b07|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25307,
"en": "I don't, but...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b07|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25308,
"en": "It's for your own good, Shizuko. You'll see.\nNow come on, let's go.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b07|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25309,
"en": "Can I, um... be alone for a bit?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b07|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25310,
"en": "...All right. I'll be back soon.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b07|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25311,
"en": "Surgery's so scary... What can I do?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b07|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25312,
"en": "Hey. What are you crying about?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b07|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25313,
"en": "My name's Kiryu. I heard what you were\ntalking about with your mom back there.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b07|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25314,
"en": "So... You need to have surgery?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b07|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 25315,
"en": "Mhm. I dunno why, but my mommy\nsays that's the only way I'll get better.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b07|#",
"max": null
}
]